quran[31]{c,v,t}:
  77,20,"Did We not create you from a (drop of) detestable fluid,"
  77,21,"and then placed it in a secure place (i.e. the mother’s womb),"
  77,22,until an appointed period (of time)?
  77,23,Then We designed (its development in stages). So how Excellent Designers We are!
  77,24,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,25,"Did We not make the earth an assembling expanse,"
  77,26,"(which contains) the living and the dead,"
  77,27,"and placed therein lofty (and) firm mountains, and gave you sweet water to drink (from refreshing springs)?"
  77,28,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,29,(They will be told:) ‘Proceed towards (the Fire) that you used to deny.
  77,30,"Proceed to the shade (of the smoke of Hellfire) that rises in three columns,"
  77,31,which provides neither coolness nor protection from the flames (of the Fire).’
  77,32,"Indeed, it throws up sparks (enormous) like lofty palaces,"
  77,33,as if they were yellow camels (coming out successively in large numbers).
  77,34,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,35,"This is the Day they will not (be able to) speak,"
  77,36,nor will they be permitted to offer excuses.
  77,37,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,38,This is the Day of Judgement. We have gathered you and the earlier generations.
  77,39,"If you have any scheme (left), then scheme against Me."
  77,40,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,41,"Indeed, the God-conscious will enjoy cool shades and springs,"
  77,42,"and fruits, such as they desire."
  77,43,(They will be told:) ‘Eat and drink joyfully (as a reward) for what you used to do.’
  77,44,"Indeed, this is how We reward the virtuously excellent."
  77,45,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,46,(O deniers!) Eat and enjoy yourselves for a short while. You are indeed evildoers.
  77,47,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,48,"When they are told: ‘Bow down (before Allah),’ they do not bow!"
  77,49,Woe to the deniers on that Day!
  77,50,"So, which discourse will they believe in after this (Qur’an)?"
